## 🎓 About

This project was built as part of **Task 1: Language Translation Tool** for the CodeAlpha Artificial Intelligence Internship.

**Task requirements covered:**
- ✅ User interface for text input and language selection
- ✅ Translation API integration
- ✅ Clear display of translated text
- ✅ Text-to-speech (optional feature)
- ✅ Additional features: auto-detection, multi-target translation, file upload, voice input, and OCR image translation

